			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ImUrX/localizedbrowser/compare/1.0.0...2.0.0\n\n## Changes:\n* Now if you add a grapheme to a letter it will only show items with that specific letter and grapheme instead of ignoring it.\n* Added extended Japanese support.\n* Added a Dependency Manager that downloads dictionaries when they are needed (only used for Japanese for now).\n* Made an API so other mods can have better support for other languages."
